<!--
  Phase T.6 — Monochrome adaptive-icon layer (Android 13+).

  Silhouette of the bat-with-calendar mascot, rendered as a single-tint
  vector so the system can re-color it from the user's themed-icon
  palette. The path data is the bat outline only — no calendar grid,
  no eye highlights — so the silhouette reads cleanly at launcher size.

  Drawn into the standard 108dp adaptive-icon safe zone (66dp visible
  inset, 21dp padding each side per Google's adaptive-icon spec).
-->
